# The runtime reads Turso, never a local file — so none of the data belongs in the bundle.
# Without this, `vercel deploy` uploads ~2.2GB of DB backups and raw cricsheet JSON.
#
# NOTE the leading slashes — these MUST stay root-anchored. A bare `db/` also matches `src/db/`,
# which silently strips the database client and fails the build with 38x "Can't resolve '@/db'".
/db/
/data/
/docs/
/scripts/
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite

# Build output and logs
/.next/
*.log
